- content_for :title, "Magic Link Login - Christmas Triage"

.container.mx-auto.px-4.py-8
  .max-w-md.mx-auto.bg-white.rounded-lg.shadow-lg.border-2.border-black.overflow-hidden
    .px-8.py-8
      .text-center.mb-6
        h1.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-2 Christmas Triage
        p.text-lg.text-gray-600 Magic Link Login

      .space-y-4
        p.text-gray-700
          | Click the button below to log in and view your cases:

        .text-center
          = link_to "Log In to View My Cases", @login_url, class: "inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-md hover:bg-purple-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-purple-500 text-lg font-medium"

        p.text-sm.text-gray-500.mt-6
          | This link will expire in 1 hour. If you didn't request this link, you can safely ignore this email.

        p.text-sm.text-gray-500.mt-4
          | Or copy and paste this URL into your browser:
          br
          = link_to @login_url, @login_url, class: "text-purple-600 underline break-all"
